          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP213 Calgary - Glenmore Park [FOUND]&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I swung down to the park today on my lunch break. This one took more digging than expected (and a metal detector to know where to do it) but I was eventually able to reveal the year and call it good before time ran out. Thanks!&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
