          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP213 Calgary - Glenmore Park [FOUND]

This was my second cap of the morning. All is proceeding according to plan. Amazing! Thanks again ofth &amp; vdD. &lt;/p&gt;

