          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP213 Calgary - Glenmore Park

N 50° 59.319 W 114° 07.957&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I like it when my GPSr maps even indicated nearby parking for this cap; it makes my life a lot easier. :-)  Because I drove, I think it's funny to see the same people at the last brass cap pass by me again at this one.  I wonder if they even noticed me (again).  I had to perform a little bit of clean up before the necessary info.  TFTBC.&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
        <groundspeak:log id="684190538">
