          <groundspeak:finder id="7573673">geoCurious2</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP213 - Calgary - Glenmore Park&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We decided to geocache on the north side of the Glenmore Reservoir today and pick up 4 Brass Caps along the way.  We parted ways with sapien who was moving to the other side of the reservoir and moved on to pick up this one,  #3.&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
