          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP213 Calgary - Glenmore Park&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The bugs are out in full force summer must be here! I even saw two superhero kites caught high up in a tree. Nice and easy to find this cap.&lt;/p&gt;

